  vendorName: Baron Bartholomew
  offerText: I need floor space for these sealed crates of imported copper immediately.
    Store them, and I will hand you a heavy stack of bills.
  acceptResultText: The massive crates fill your room, but the cash in your pocket
    feels fantastic.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to clutter your room. You breathe easily in your open
    space.
  acceptedDelayedText: The crates weren't copper; they were leaking toxic industrial
    chemicals! You feel terribly ill.
  rejectedDelayedText: 'You read the paper: the Baron''s crates weren''t copper;
    they were leaking toxic industrial chemicals! You feel yourself lucky.'
